  "description": "EDITORIAL defaults applied per track at seed import. Deliberately separate from tracks.v1.json, which contains only facts stated in portfolio-project-selection.md. Everything here is a reviewed human choice, declared once at track level. It is NOT per-project inference, which PRD 5.1.1 forbids ('Never: unreviewed generative inference'). An author overrides any of these on an individual record; the importer never re-derives them once a manifest exists.",
